ve section is omitted when blocking unread exists. Behavior change is concentrated in one function.\n\n**Validation plan** (per notebook): run for a week and measure (a) reply length per by:human-prompted discuss, (b) tool calls per reply turn (Read/Grep/Explore/WebSearch), (c) replies citing specific code locations / ADRs / PRs, (d) whether the agent ever uses WebSearch for a tracker reply (currently 0 across ~6500 records).\n\nNOT a governance file — packages/hypergumbo-tracker/src/hypergumbo_tracker/stop_hook.py is application code."  # 98aa
